          }
        },
        "2df01cc7-0c9f-4f58-8316-fa5bafacc0db": {
          "type": "Accordions",
          "settings": {
            "tab_content_title": "Collaboration",
            "tab_content_headline": "",
            "tab_content_description": "",
            "tab_content_question": "Collaborations and donations",
            "tab_content_answer": "<p>We love working with creative individuals who are active, outgoing, and engaged in their communities. While we wish we could collaborate with everyone and support every cause, we unfortunately don't have the capacity. <\/p><p>If you'd like to be considered, please send an email to contact@threadwallets.com with your name, email, company name, website, social media handle(s), number of products being requested, mailing address, and a description of your event, collaboration, charity, etc.  <\/p><p>We will review your request and a member of our team will reach out within 1-2 weeks!<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "dc2db9fa-a623-444f-a85c-e3e91e0fd63c": {
          "type": "Accordions",
          "settings": {
            "tab_content_title": "Collaboration",
            "tab_content_headline": "",
            "tab_content_description": "",
            "tab_content_question": "Careers at Thread",
            "tab_content_answer": "<p>At Thread, our culture sets us apart and influences everything we do. <strong>We are family.<\/strong> By joining the Thread family, you will be immersed in an environment of supportive and collaborative people.<\/p><p>For more information on job openings at Thread, check out our <a href=\"https:\/\/www.threadwallets.com\/pages\/careers\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Careers<\/span><\/a> page! <\/p>"
          }
        },
        "bb3e1a5c-61af-4b10-b5bc-68f7782ecd06": {
          "type": "Accordions",
          "settings": {
            "tab_content_title": "General",
            "tab_content_headline": "",
            "tab_content_description": "",
            "tab_content_question": "How do I cancel my order?",
            "tab_content_answer": "<p>After an order has been placed, customers have 1 hour of processing time to cancel their order on their end. After an hour is up, you can reach out to our customer service team at <a href=\"mailto:contact@threadwallets.com\" target=\"_blank\">contact@threadwallets.com<\/a> to see if the order is still able to be canceled.<\/p>"
          }
        }
      },
